    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="81ce7374-dfcd-5700-88c4-1aa23386df1a" activityNameId="db2e9048-ba17-553f-a4bc-e74308d2ed20" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Photovoltaic cell, mc-Si, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Photovoltaic cell, mc-Si, at plant
Production of photovoltaic cells (100cm2) with an efficiency of 15.4% and 1.5Wp.;
UUID: 22200e1a-f204-32c1-b381-34f0aa675024
Cleaning, damage etching, texture etching, covering of backside, phosphor dotation, phosphor glass etching, printing of contacts, cleaning and quality testing.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production of photovoltaic cells from wafers.
Time period: Most of the data published in 1992, some newer information.
Production volume: Total worldwide production 243MW in 2000. Europe 37MW.
Sampling: Publication of plant specific (partly aggregated) data.  
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_22200e1a-f204-32c1-b381-34f0aa675024.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
